@startuml mmda_core_modules
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
set namespaceSeparator none
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 18
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ArrowColor #6a6a6a
title mmda-core 5.0.0　模块架构与依赖（13 个 module）
package "基础层" {
  component "mmda-core-utils\n24 类型 / 3,977 行" as M_utils
}
package "元数据 / 实体层" {
  component "mmda-core-metadata\n105 类型 / 11,581 行" as M_metadata
  component "mmda-core-entities\n52 类型 / 6,071 行" as M_entities
}
package "SQL 内核（新栈）" {
  component "mmda-core-sql\n55 类型 / 65,193 行" as M_sql
}
package "数据访问层（旧栈主干 + 缓存）" {
  component "mmda-core-data\n67 类型 / 11,952 行" as M_data
  component "mmda-core-caching\n10 类型 / 1,765 行" as M_caching
}
package "服务与接口层" {
  component "mmda-core-services\n32 类型 / 6,409 行" as M_services
  component "mmda-core-api\n14 类型 / 3,372 行" as M_api
}
package "横切能力" {
  component "mmda-core-file\n48 类型 / 9,585 行" as M_file
  component "mmda-core-security\n35 类型 / 2,795 行" as M_security
  component "mmda-core-messaging\n36 类型 / 2,160 行" as M_messaging
}
package "空壳 / 聚合" {
  component "mmda-core-reporting\n无源码 · 空壳" as M_reporting
}
component "mmda-core-dependencies\n只导出 BOM" as M_dep
M_dep .[hidden].> M_dep
M_api --> M_caching
M_api --> M_data
M_api --> M_entities
M_api --> M_metadata
M_api --> M_security
M_api --> M_services
M_entities --> M_metadata
M_entities --> M_sql
M_entities --> M_utils
M_messaging --> M_utils
M_metadata --> M_utils
M_security --> M_entities
M_security --> M_metadata
M_security --> M_utils
M_services --> M_file
M_services --> M_messaging
M_sql --> M_metadata
M_sql --> M_utils
legend right
  <b>依赖口径（真源 mmda-core/*/pom.xml）</b>
  实线 = 源码模块依赖（scope=compile），18 条
  另有 16 条依赖走 scope=system 的预编译 jar（未画线）：
  api→utils · caching→entities · caching→metadata · caching→utils · data→entities · data→metadata · data→utils · file→data · file→entities · file→metadata · services→caching · services→data · services→entities · services→metadata · services→security · services→utils
  该 jar 在 ${mmda.local.repository}（mmda-core/pom.xml:47）下，改上游源码后必须重新 install 才生效
  mmda-core-reporting：目录 + pom 在、无源码；mmda-core-dependencies：只导出 BOM
endlegend
@enduml
